                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "First thing: this VN is [i]crazy as f*ck[/i]. Don’t take it seriously. The opening of the game says it all (if you already watched, you KNOW what I’m talking about. Big E’s “special weapon”, especially. That was… Yeah), so if you feel triggered/angered by racial slurs, tons of rude words, “stereotypical” characters, violence… This game isn’t for you. It will piss you off.\n\nBUT if you don’t mind and feel like reading something weird, go for it. Although, I recommend getting this game on a good sale; it’s not so short, but it’s quite expensive for a kinetic VN. Not worth paying the full price, in my opinion.\n\nThe art style is cute, BG and BGM were good. The VA was okay, I just found that men voices were a bit too low than the female voices. Intro and ending songs were also good.\n\n5/10. The story had potential, but I think they focused more on the crazy dialogues than the story itself. \n\nAnd by the way, here is my favorite dialogue:\n[spoiler]Big E: What a boring bunch. Don’t they have any balls?\nLackey 2: They died, so no, they have no balls.[/spoiler]\nlol",
